{"code":200,"message":"OK","tweet":{"url":"https://x.com/yupi996/status/2090649288535921094","id":"2090649288535921094","text":"","raw_text":{"text":"https://t.co/UrjCW8obzD","display_text_range":[0,23],"facets":[]},"author":{"screen_name":"yupi996","url":"https://x.com/yupi996","id":"2000617411247251456","followers":27521,"following":238,"likes":308,"media_count":225,"name":"程序员鱼皮","description":"专注 AI + 编程教育 | 编程导航站长 http://codefather.cn\n⭐️ 全网 200w 关注，独立开发→腾讯全栈→创业中\n😈 项目狂魔，10+上线产品，GitHub 20k+ followers\n❤️ 感谢关注，AI 资源获取 http://ai.codefather.cn","raw_description":{"text":"专注 AI + 编程教育 | 编程导航站长 https://t.co/89dNxo4a3J\n⭐️ 全网 200w 关注，独立开发→腾讯全栈→创业中\n😈 项目狂魔，10+上线产品，GitHub 20k+ followers\n❤️ 感谢关注，AI 资源获取 https://t.co/016as14C0T","facets":[{"type":"url","indices":[22,45],"original":"https://t.co/89dNxo4a3J","replacement":"http://codefather.cn","display":"codefather.cn"},{"type":"url","indices":[127,150],"original":"https://t.co/016as14C0T","replacement":"http://ai.codefather.cn","display":"ai.codefather.cn"}]},"location":"China","banner_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2000617411247251456/1765819965","avatar_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/2000617981035044864/5pXwSkUN_200x200.jpg","joined":"Mon Dec 15 17:22:30 +0000 2025","protected":false,"website":{"url":"https://github.com/liyupi","display_url":"github.com/liyupi"},"verification":{"verified":true,"verified_at":null,"type":"individual"},"avatar_color":null},"replies":5,"retweets":13,"likes":74,"bookmarks":114,"quotes":1,"created_at":"Fri Aug 21 03:56:47 +0000 2026","created_timestamp":1787284607,"possibly_sensitive":false,"views":12283,"is_note_tweet":false,"community_note":null,"lang":null,"replying_to":null,"replying_to_status":null,"source":"Twitter Web App","article":{"created_at":"2026-08-21T03:56:47.000Z","modified_at":"2026-08-21T03:56:47.000Z","id":"2090637967438303232","title":"16 个超火的 DeepSeek Harness 插件，大肥鱼已经落后 N 个版本了。。。","preview_text":"大家好，我是程序员鱼皮。\nDeepSeek Harness 是 DeepSeek 官方最新开源的 AI Agent 运行环境，简称 DSH。\n你可以把它理解成一个高度可定制的 AI 编程工具，对标 Claude Code 和 Codex，核心理念是「一切皆插件」。","cover_media":{"id":"QXBpTWVkaWE6DAAFCgABHQN1+gCaUAEKAAIbw57vkNqgAAAA","media_id":"2090644368642428929","media_info":{"__typename":"ApiImage","color_info":{"palette":[{"percentage":99.46,"rgb":{"blue":250,"green":245,"red":242}},{"percentage":0.35,"rgb":{"blue":208,"green":176,"red":153}},{"percentage":0.18,"rgb":{"blue":153,"green":134,"red":127}}]},"original_img_height":1134,"original_img_url":"https://pbs.twimg.com/media/HQN1-gCaUAEuehv.jpg","original_img_width":2834},"media_key":"3_2090644368642428929"},"content":{"blocks":[{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"smk7u","text":"大家好，我是程序员鱼皮。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"0ytkj","text":"DeepSeek Harness 是 DeepSeek 官方最新开源的 AI Agent 运行环境，简称 DSH。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"kmyog","text":"你可以把它理解成一个高度可定制的 AI 编程工具，对标 Claude Code 和 Codex，核心理念是「一切皆插件」。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ge46g","text":"DSH 整套架构是建立在一个叫 Cordis 的元框架上的。模型适配器、工具注册表、会话日志、Agent 循环，甚至 Web 界面本身，全都是可以热插拔的插件。你想换模型、换工具、换交互方式，改一下配置就行，不用动源码。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"zifek","text":"虽然目前 DSH 自带的能力还不够丰富，但正因为这种彻底的插件化设计，社区补能力的速度非常快。才短短一周多，GitHub 的 `dsh-plugin` 标签下已经冒出了数千个社区插件，有给 Agent 补充能力的、有改进 UI 界面的、也有很多奇奇怪怪的抽象艺术作品……","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"iaxaq","text":"本期我就来带大家鉴赏一大波 DeepSeek Harness 热门插件，有实用的、也有好看的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"mukan","text":"鱼皮甄选，量大管饱。建议收藏，让你的鲸鱼变得更强！","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c7r61","text":"发现优质 DSH 插件","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5wxvw","text":"首先，到哪里去找 DeepSeek Harness 的优质插件呢？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":0,"length":15,"offset":18}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bft4v","text":"最直接的方法是看 GitHub 的 dsh-plugin 主题专区。很多开发者发布插件后都会给仓库打上 `dsh-plugin` 这个标签，新出的插件基本都能在这里看到。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"uyu66","text":"这个方法的优点是更新快、数量多；缺点就是鱼龙混杂，因为谁都可以给仓库加这个标签，不代表这些插件经过审核，也不能按照质量来排序。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":1,"length":18,"offset":16}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dzydg","text":"如果懒得一个个翻仓库，可以看看 Awesome DSH Plugin。它是社区整理出来的一份优质插件清单，按照用途做分类，便于你快速发现一些热门插件。不过它同样属于社区维护，适合拿来找插件、看热度，不能当做是官方推荐的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6nnuy","text":"有趣的是，DSH 插件多起来以后，连「找插件」这件事本身都被做成插件了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"he7vl","text":"比如我后面会提到的 dsh-market 插件，把它装进 DeepSeek Harness 后就相当于多了一个插件市场。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"l1bwb","text":"在这里你不仅能够直接浏览和搜索插件，还能看到根据你当前已安装的插件继续推荐的相关项目。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"c3cp9","text":"举个例子，我不用提前知道 dsh-pocket 这个插件叫什么名字，只要搜索「远程」两个字，dsh-market 插件就会匹配到对应的项目。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":2,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ktdfo","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"akqmp","text":"那怎么安装插件呢？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"eccn8","text":"其实不用自己折腾命令，我基本都是直接把 GitHub 仓库地址丢给 DeepSeek Harness，让 AI 自己读取仓库的 README 项目介绍文件、查找安装方式、执行安装命令，装完以后按照 AI 的提示重启 `dsh web` 就行。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":3,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"scttn","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ykgkn","text":"优质 DSH 插件推荐","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8ia0o","text":"接下来正式进入插件推荐环节。我把这次测试过的插件分成了 3 类，分别是扩展 DSH 技能的、增强面板体验的，以及社区整活的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"hkh6f","text":"下面先来看第一类，能直接给 DSH 补能力的插件。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"xdtr5","text":"### DSH 技能扩展","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cffha","text":"#### ModLens 让 DeepSeek 理解图片","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"sob88","text":"这是我个人最看好的一个插件，给原本只能看文字的 AI 模型补了一双慧眼。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/liustack/modlens","toIndex":40}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"nipwx","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/liustack/modlens","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cw8lb","text":"DeepSeek V4 系列模型只能处理纯文本。虽然 DeepSeek 官方 APP 里已经灰度上线了识图模式，但在 DSH 里调用的是 API 接口，如果你直接粘贴一张截图进对话，AI 根本看不懂。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"43hsa","text":"ModLens 解决的就是这个问题。当你粘贴图片后，插件会自动把图片转发给一个外部的视觉模型（比如 Qwen），由视觉模型把图片内容解析成结构化的 JSON 信息，包括 OCR 识别出的文字、页面的布局区域，以及图片里的语义内容，然后再把这些信息作为上下文喂给 DeepSeek，让它能够基于图片内容继续推理。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":4,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5zlje","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"zrqq5","text":"和普通的 OCR 工具不一样，ModLens 保留的不只是文字，还有元素之间的位置关系和语义。所以对于经常用 AI 做前端的朋友来说非常实用，页面做完以后直接把截图丢给 DSH，让它自己检查还原度就行了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":15,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"u781f","text":"#### ModSearch 扩展搜索源","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tfgy9","text":"ModSearch 是一个搜索增强插件，可以给 DSH 接入 Firecrawl、Tavily、Exa 等不同搜索源，还能继续扩展 Twitter 搜索的能力。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/liustack/modsearch","toIndex":42}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dvrej","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/liustack/modsearch","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"mo871","text":"虽然 DSH 原生就自带联网搜索，但是搜索范围有限。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4vaer","text":"比如我让 AI 搜索当天 Twitter 上关于 DeepSeek Harness 的讨论，AI 明确告诉我当前搜索工具拿不到 Twitter 的实时原帖，只能从媒体和社区文章里找到一些转述内容。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"48xa3","text":"装上 ModSearch 后，我故意没有配置 API Key，又让 AI 搜索同一个问题。这一次 AI 直接搜到了一条 Twitter 上的原帖，点开链接就能验证。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":5,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"q3wgk","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"t8c9j","text":"不过 Twitter 搜索到这一步并没有完全跑通，更完整的搜索能力还需要额外配置对应服务的 API Key 才能用。如果你平时需要在全网范围深度检索资料，配好之后会很香。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"sqekg","text":"#### dsh-browser 操作浏览器","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"bz7n2","text":"dsh-browser 可以让 DSH 直接操作你正在用的 Chrome 浏览器，比如读取网页内容、点击链接、填写表单、跳转页面等等。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/Lum1104/dsh-browser","toIndex":43}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"hm3q9","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/Lum1104/dsh-browser","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"sot66","text":"和一般的无头浏览器方案不同，dsh-browser 连接的是你电脑上真实的 Chrome 标签页。浏览器里的 Cookie、Session、登录状态全都能直接复用，不需要给 AI 单独再登录一次。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"uywbj","text":"它的技术方案是一个 DSH 桥接插件加一个 Chrome MV3 扩展，两边通过本地 WebSocket 通信。插件把网页内容转成结构化的文本描述（带编号的可交互元素列表）发给 DeepSeek，DeepSeek 不需要「看图」就能理解页面结构并执行操作。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4twxu","text":"这个插件的安装会稍微麻烦一点。除了安装 dsh-browser 插件本身，还得额外在 Chrome 里加载一个本地扩展。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"kkznv","text":"我直接让 DSH 按照插件的 README 文档自动安装。AI 把源码、依赖和扩展都构建好了，最后只需要我在 Chrome 的 `chrome://extensions` 页面手动加载本地扩展目录。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":6,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"r7ros","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dodvy","text":"扩展打开后，看到 `Connected` 就说明连接成功了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"0wx9d","text":"我先拿 GitHub 做了一轮测试，把自己的开源项目主页丢给它，让它找到页面里的置顶仓库，再点进去继续查看详情。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5mbsn","text":"从读取页面、定位仓库，到点击进入并读取项目信息，整套流程全部跑通。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":7,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"milbf","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"nahou","text":"接下来我又让 AI 通过 Twitter 页面搜索 DSH 相关内容。结果它真的在 Twitter 的搜索框里自动输入关键词、执行搜索，再切到最新结果查看刚发布的帖子。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":8,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"txh5g","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"24lzp","text":"这和前面的 ModSearch 插件定位不同。ModSearch 更适合从搜索引擎渠道查找资料，而 dsh-browser 是让 AI 直接操作你已经登录的真实网站，适合填表、发帖、查询后台这种需要带登录态的操作。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"n5enl","text":"不过 dsh-browser 并不会完全放任 Agent 随便操作。点击、输入、页面跳转这些动作默认都会弹确认框让你过目。手动切换标签页后，它也会停下来询问是继续控制原页面还是跟随当前页面。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"xfxc9","text":"实际使用时还有一个小细节值得注意。dsh-browser 默认绑定当前活动标签页，如果直接在 DSH 页面里让它打开 GitHub，当前聊天页面可能也会被跳走。后来我改成先打开目标网站的标签页，再从 Chrome 侧边栏发起对话，用起来就顺手多了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cdist","text":"#### Agent Teams 组一支 Agent 团队","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"hzpdz","text":"Agent Teams 是一个多 Agent 协作插件，可以让 DSH 同时拉起多个 Agent 各自干活，结果统一汇总到一个 Captain（队长）节点。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/NanmiCoder/dsh-agent-teams","toIndex":50}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"s9r37","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/NanmiCoder/dsh-agent-teams","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"av798","text":"Captain 负责拆分任务、分配工作并做最终汇总，下面的成员 Agent 则各自处理不同方向的问题。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5j63x","text":"我拿它检查了一个前端项目，创建了 3 个成员分别负责不同维度：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":9,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"zcs85","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fonym","text":"任务跑起来以后，右边的活动面板能直接看到 3 个 Agent 同时在工作。等它们各自检查完成，结果会统一回到 Captain，由 Captain 汇总并给出最终报告。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":10,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f8srg","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[{"length":39,"offset":0,"style":"Bold"}],"key":"oi6cd","text":"更牛的是，这支 Agent 团队做完一次任务后不会马上消失，后面还能继续复用。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6kthb","text":"这一轮检查结束后，我又追问了一个 WebGL 降级的问题，并且指定只让 frontend 成员继续处理。结果活动面板里真的只有它重新进入了工作状态，另外两个成员没有被重复调度。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ehd8a","text":"所以它和临时开多个 Agent 还是有区别的。创建好的团队和成员会一直保留，后续可以按需指派任务。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"h2y01","text":"对于代码审查、多维度调研这类能拆成多个方向的任务，用 Agent Teams 比较合适。但如果任务本身很简单，就没必要特意拉一支队伍，反而会增加调度时间和 Token 消耗。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6ld4v","text":"### DSH 实用工具与界面","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"lto78","text":"接下来是第二类，这些插件主要增强 DSH 的面板能力和使用体验，日常用起来更顺手。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4hk8e","text":"#### dsh-market 给 DSH 装个插件市场","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"wdena","text":"前面说过，DSH 插件越来越多以后，光靠自己翻 GitHub 找插件其实挺麻烦的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6t7wo","text":"dsh-market 相当于在 DSH 里内置了一个插件市场，不用离开 DSH 就能浏览、搜索和安装插件，还会根据你已经安装的插件推荐相关项目。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/2BingLing/dsh-market","toIndex":44}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"w8fwo","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/2BingLing/dsh-market","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f51wt","text":"常用的功能有 2 个，第一个是个性化推荐。插件知道你已经装了什么，推荐的东西会越来越对味儿，不用每次都自己寻找新的插件。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"te960","text":"第二个是按功能关键词搜索插件。比如我想找一个可以用手机远程控制 DSH 的插件，只要搜「远程」两个字就能匹配到相关项目，不需要提前记住插件名字。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":11,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"9moov","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cpv5y","text":"#### dsh-web-ui 网站功能增强","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cyr8x","text":"dsh-web-ui 是一个 Web 端增强插件，集成了任务看板、Git 管理、工作台、状态信息、皮肤主题和桌宠等一系列功能，装完以后整个页面会更像一个完整的开发工具。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web-ui","toIndex":48}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"wvdl4","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/zhu1090093659/dsh-web-ui","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"aqzm0","text":"我一开始看到它的名字，还以为只是简单改改界面样式。结果装完才发现，这东西简直是一个超级全家桶！","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":12,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"926tm","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"dhb1l","text":"我最先试的功能是任务看板。你可以直接新建任务，写清楚要让 Agent 做什么，任务从开始到完成的进度都会显示在看板里，而且点进去还能找到真正执行这个任务的 DSH 会话。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":13,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"981nh","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"h26tc","text":"它把 Git 相关功能做得也很完整。可以直接搜索、切换和新建分支，还能把之前的代码提交记录画成一张 Git 图谱，把每次提交和不同分支之间的关系都清晰地展示出来。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":14,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"6v4oe","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tevpy","text":"我装的是 `dsh-web-ui` 的全家桶版本，它还会一起安装 `dsh-better-sidebar`，所以右边会直接多出一套类似 VS Code 的开发工具栏。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":15,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"cljne","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"xo0m6","text":"全家桶集成的 better-sidebar 里，文件列表还带了 `@文件` 按钮，看到需要的文件可以直接引用到当前对话里，不用再自己手动复制路径。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3es3e","text":"怎么样，这个插件是不是挺强的？感觉官方没做的很多功能都被它实现了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"et8ej","text":"#### DSH-better-sidebar 加强侧边栏","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ig0f6","text":"DSH-better-sidebar 是一个侧边栏增强插件，把文件树、终端、Git 状态这些开发时常用的面板集中到 DSH 右侧，减少来回切窗口的麻烦。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar","toIndex":52}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8i2f7","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/omdsh-dev/DSH-better-sidebar","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"n2z4f","text":"和前面的 `dsh-web-ui` 相比，它没有任务看板、皮肤中心、桌宠这些额外功能，更专注于侧边栏本身，界面也更简洁。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"otiti","text":"如果你觉得全家桶功能太多用不上，也可以只装这一个，单独用更轻量。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ciluh","text":"#### dsh-context 上下文增强","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tmtcz","text":"dsh-context 是一个上下文可视化插件，可以直接查看当前会话里上下文的组成情况、占用比例和变化记录。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/bowenliang123/dsh-context","toIndex":49}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"81kju","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/bowenliang123/dsh-context","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8og68","text":"用 AI 编程聊久了以后，经常会发现对话越来越慢、上下文越堆越大。但到底是历史消息、文件内容还是工具调用结果占了大头，平时其实很难直观看出来。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"nlboq","text":"`dsh-context` 做的就是把这些原本藏在后台的数据直接摊开给你看。点一下上下文按钮，就能看到当前上下文的体检报告，每一类信息占了多少 Token 一目了然。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":16,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8n0gp","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"vdosk","text":"如果你经常跑长会话或者频繁调用工具，它会很实用。至少上下文快顶满的时候，你能知道该清理什么，不用再盲目地直接开一个新会话。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"yht3a","text":"#### dsh-TUI 终端操作界面","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"zky7a","text":"dsh-TUI 是一个终端交互界面插件，适合更习惯 Claude Code 那种终端操作风格的用户。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/ccch1mneyyy/dsh-TUI","toIndex":43}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"x6z1g","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/ccch1mneyyy/dsh-TUI","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"n6239","text":"装好运行以后，会直接进入一套全屏终端界面，底部实时显示当前模型、推理强度、上下文占用百分比等信息，简单粗暴。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":17,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7rka6","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f4j1e","text":"但是我不太建议新手直接装这个，因为 dsh-TUI 对 DSH 的界面和交互改动比较大，而 DSH 官方还在快速迭代中，后续如果新增了什么能力或者改了接口，这个插件不见得能第一时间跟上，到时候出了兼容问题排查起来会比较头疼。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"lmfu7","text":"#### dsh-genui 界面渲染","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7wosv","text":"dsh-genui 是一个生成式 UI 插件，可以让 DSH 的回复不再局限于文字和 Markdown，而是直接在对话里渲染卡片、图表、选项按钮等交互界面。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/omdsh-dev/dsh-genui","toIndex":43}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8b9q9","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/omdsh-dev/dsh-genui","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"zdz5t","text":"我新开了一个对话，让它生成一个「AI 编程工具对比面板」，包含信息卡片和柱状图。结果真的直接在 DSH 的聊天窗口里渲染了出来，而且是实实在在可以交互的组件。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":18,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"27ohn","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4weyh","text":"如果你经常让 AI 做数据展示或者方案对比，觉得纯文字回答太单调，这个插件值得一试。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5p3fn","text":"#### dsh-pocket 手机远程操控","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"x0yd9","text":"dsh-pocket 可以把电脑上正在运行的 DSH 连接到手机上，扫一下二维码就能在手机浏览器里继续查看 Agent 的工作状态、发送消息。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/shaobeichen/dsh-pocket","toIndex":46}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8o83p","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/shaobeichen/dsh-pocket","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"2pb7n","text":"这个插件支持局域网和公网两种模式，我都测试过了。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1w4j4","text":"局域网模式很简单，手机和电脑连同一个 WiFi，扫描二维码后就能直接打开 DSH 界面。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":19,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7bred","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"91dts","text":"公网模式更通用，手机不需要和电脑在同一个网络里，随时随地可以访问。第一次打开会要求输入一个访问密码，每次重新开启公网访问时密码会自动更换。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":20,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f2a57","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"nd3ce","text":"最关键的是，公网访问不需要你自己额外买服务器！dsh-pocket 会通过 Cloudflare Quick Tunnel 建立一个临时的公网通道，把外部请求转发到电脑本地运行的 DSH。手机端和电脑端之间的流式输出通过 WebSocket 全程透传，电脑上正在输出的内容手机上也能实时滚动。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"u9gsq","text":"也就是说，以后 DSH 在电脑上跑一个耗时较长的任务，我出去吃饭的时候掏出手机还能继续看进度、发消息。美滋滋～","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3vsuq","text":"不过方便的同时，也要注意安全。远程二维码、公网地址和访问密码别随便分享给别人，毕竟 DSH 本身可以操作本机文件和代码，暴露的后果可想而知……","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"vmtb0","text":"### DSH 整活玩法","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"k03ao","text":"前面两类插件多少还在认真地给 DSH 补充能力、优化体验。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"tyeul","text":"接下来，插件的画风就开始逐渐跑偏。。。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7s8uh","text":"#### dsh-deep-whale 鲸鱼娘皮肤","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"53l9y","text":"deep-whale 是一个主题插件，装上以后，整个 Web 界面会直接换成鲸鱼娘风格。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale","toIndex":52}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"839ra","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deep-whale","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7xx9d","text":"装上以后的效果，直接看图：","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":21,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7cn4h","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ufd89","text":"效果不错吧，是不是突然更有打开 DSH 的动力了？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"06fa3","text":"虽然它并没有给 DSH 增加新功能，但不得不说，这种东西确实很适合社区传播，谁看了这个图不想装一个？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"4e3yv","text":"#### whale-girl 互动更强的桌宠","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"fvr61","text":"whale-girl 是一个桌宠插件，可以直接在 DSH 里养一只萌萌哒鲸鱼娘桌宠。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/vlln/whale-girl","toIndex":39}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"zskse","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/vlln/whale-girl","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"m9dq2","text":"前面的 dsh-web-ui 插件也带了桌宠功能，不过我实际对比下来，两边体验差别还挺明显的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"p4uag","text":"dsh-web-ui 自带的桌宠更像一个「工作状态提示器」，Agent 干活时会告诉你正在整理资料、任务完成了之类的。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5ejro","text":"而 whale-girl 更像以前的 QQ 宠物。鼠标悬浮上去可以看到等级和当前状态，点开菜单还能投喂、玩耍。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":22,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"a9hik","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"x6ggr","text":"它还会跟着 Agent 的工作状态做不同动作，比如思考的时候歪头、等待的时候打哈欠、完成任务后欢呼、空闲久了就开始睡觉。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"raitl","text":"虽然实际上没什么用，但是能提升使用 AI 的情绪价值，还要什么自行车？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"y1ftx","text":"#### dsh-liang-skin 滑动变祖器","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"gperf","text":"dsh-liang-skin 是一个 DSH 皮肤插件，直接把推理强度滑块做成了「滑动变祖器」。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/kingOfSoySauce/dsh-liang-skin","toIndex":53}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"pukzp","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/kingOfSoySauce/dsh-liang-skin","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"7h00p","text":"来试试看，拖动推理强度的时候，你能够见证人物从梁子一路进化到梁祖的过程。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":23,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8720o","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"q7ku3","text":"这真的是碳基生物能想到的创意吗？？？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"whd5j","text":"#### dsh-deepcel 把 DSH 伪装成 Excel","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"8xupz","text":"dsh-deepcel 是一个 Excel 风格的主题插件，装上以后整个页面会变成经典的表格界面。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deepcel","toIndex":49}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"lhtoq","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/Small-tailqwq/dsh-deepcel","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"1sxlr","text":"看下效果，还原度还是很高的吧？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":24,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"b31ns","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"gs77u","text":"感觉这玩意很适合经常用 Excel 办公的同学，当成一个摸鱼神器应该挺好","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"pk4ga","text":"#### dsh-ads 把广告塞进 DSH","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"laqd2","text":"dsh-ads 是一个专门给 DSH 塞复古广告的整活插件。装上以后，整个页面会冒出各种 2005 年中文互联网风格的弹窗广告。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{"urls":[{"fromIndex":5,"text":"https://github.com/Nagi-ovo/dsh-ads","toIndex":40}]},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"yzpaf","text":"开源仓库：https://github.com/Nagi-ovo/dsh-ads","type":"blockquote"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"lpf41","text":"信息流广告、弹窗、假杀毒、假游戏，还有各种花里胡哨的横幅，全都能往 DSH 里塞。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":25,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"wh14o","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"m44sg","text":"抽象，太抽象了！你管这叫 AI 工具？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"f7gfp","text":"最后哔哔","type":"header-two"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"0te5t","text":"最后，我把这次测试过的精选 DSH 插件按照使用场景整理成了一张图，够贴心吧？","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":26,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"5qevl","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"ryt6v","text":"多说两句，虽然 DeepSeek Harness 一切皆插件的设计给了大家无限的定制空间，但插件毕竟是第三方代码，尤其是会操作浏览器、Shell、文件和远程访问的插件，一定要注意安全，安装前最好去看一下仓库来源和它声明的权限范围。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"h2kfn","text":"而且 DSH 自身也还在快速迭代，很多插件不一定能做到完美兼容。像我这次测试过程中就遇到过因为插件版本不兼容导致 Web 无法正常启动的情况。所以我建议只安装有刚需的插件，而且要利用 Git 版本控制工具来管理本地的 DSH，出了问题也好回滚到之前正常的版本。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":27,"length":14,"offset":35}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"qoi62","text":"OK 就分享到这里。如果你对 AI 编程感兴趣，欢迎阅读我免费开源的 《AI 编程零基础入门教程》，上千张图、几十万字，带你从 0 开始快速学会 AI 编程，做出自己的产品、跑通变现全流程，一次拿捏。","type":"unstyled"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[{"key":28,"length":1,"offset":0}],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"3hrf7","text":" ","type":"atomic"},{"data":{},"entityRanges":[],"inlineStyleRanges":[],"key":"779gv","text":"你还发现了哪些好玩或者实用的 DSH 插件？欢迎在评论区补充。","type":"unstyled"}],"entityMap":[{"key":"12","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"f55ad1e8-9155-488a-8e5b-730253cdcd2e","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"31","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090645890709286912"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"8","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"924979d4-5fe8-4f80-9fc1-f74f25608212","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"17","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090638325661216768"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"19","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"0b450735-9cd0-4d6b-9c34-1b8a8ee0f229","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"51","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090648422026240000"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"23","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"72d4e2c8-7731-4b0f-b1b8-3071545c7763","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"57","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090648879545159680"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"4","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"c92c6849-bf10-4e0e-a3cd-80c4aa1b0982","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"8","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090638157343817728"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"15","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"2d6f9358-12ab-4497-adf9-77c614c91fb2","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"35","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090646371313524736"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"11","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"97bc64a7-afe1-4e93-82ff-dd54fd8e8c27","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"20","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090638101664436225"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"9","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"baa2e525-6a32-458c-8595-5c78f4aea8bc","markdown":"```\n前端 Agent：检查页面结构、交互逻辑、响应式和明显的前端问题\n代码质量 Agent：检查项目结构、依赖管理和代码可维护性\n安全 Agent：检查敏感信息泄露、依赖风险和明显的安全隐患\n```"},"mutability":"Mutable","type":"MARKDOWN"}},{"key":"22","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"d973c94b-6ad7-4b82-add3-808ec728ff08","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"60","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090649244508299264"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"26","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"74b57b85-2ec3-431f-ac27-44b2ab71afa4","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"24","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090644662436741120"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"13","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"69aac276-d4be-459b-97ee-90d2ce0a9fe5","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"33","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090645984770760704"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"24","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"6e53d975-c0a9-42e0-b3a5-d52b2e27cec3","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"26","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage","mediaId":"2090644799795900416"}]},"mutability":"Immutable","type":"MEDIA"}},{"key":"16","value":{"data":{"entityKey":"2512ad05-0d9a-4b95-afeb-afd8a14ae670","mediaItems":[{"localMediaId":"44","mediaCategory":"DraftTweetImage"